{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a special manor that rests on the side of your screen. Battle invading monsters, then recruit them to become your diligent farmers. Develop your estate and challenge new levels during work and leisure, making your manor more prosperous and powerful than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/a6a7c6fbf86f50b911bc5e184d8383ae.poster.avif?t=1755088443\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/a6a7c6fbf86f50b911bc5e184d8383ae.webm?t=1755088443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/a6a7c6fbf86f50b911bc5e184d8383ae.mp4?t=1755088443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;From this day forward, say goodbye to war. Plant fields, harvest crops, with food and shelter provided. The monster farmers will now live a new life of peace and contentment.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-Intrusive Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Manor sits quietly on the side of your screen, never disturbing your daily work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automated Production</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your diligent monster farmers will automatically plant, water, and harvest, continuously generating gold for you. Hundreds of monsters will become your exclusive farmers, achieving full automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/745532fd8bb662ddfb2c431546831749.poster.avif?t=1755088443\" width=568 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/745532fd8bb662ddfb2c431546831749.webm?t=1755088443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on ever-escalating levels and tidal waves of enemies. Face more powerful bosses and bring them all under your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/bd866b727986a601661c27ec105288ff.poster.avif?t=1755088443\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/bd866b727986a601661c27ec105288ff.webm?t=1755088443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/bd866b727986a601661c27ec105288ff.mp4?t=1755088443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Tower Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a wide variety of defensive towers, each with unique upgrade paths, to construct an impregnable line of defense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade powerful skills to maximize your damage output!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864360?t=1755088443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/cef87e6c012858fd40209e413c98d35e68e8e76b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755088443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/f7282b6a97d557a4536ebef68a49239e4b78a473/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755088443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/f7282b6a97d557a4536ebef68a49239e4b78a473/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755088443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Ste