ll automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/745532fd8bb662ddfb2c431546831749.poster.avif?t=1755088443\" width=568 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/745532fd8bb662ddfb2c431546831749.webm?t=1755088443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on ever-escalating levels and tidal waves of enemies. Face more powerful bosses and bring them all under your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/bd866b727986a601661c27ec105288ff.poster.avif?t=1755088443\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/bd866b727986a601661c27ec105288ff.webm?t=1755088443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/extras/bd866b727986a601661c27ec105288ff.mp4?t=1755088443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Tower Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a wide variety of defensive towers, each with unique upgrade paths, to construct an impregnable line of defense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade powerful skills to maximize your damage output!</p>","developers":["Soda Duck"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864360/543b351a1c6dc477a5963400040c5a5cd314ba5c/header.jpg?t=1755088443","is_free":false,"linu